78
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,880
Toute la famille t'accompagne.

79
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,480
Ma tante,

80
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:43,920
Tianxin t'accompagne.

81
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:45,800
D'accord.

82
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:47,600
Tianxin va accompagner tante aussi, d'accord ?

83
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,440
D'accord.

84
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:01,080
Zhenniang,

85
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,760
ton père et ton grand-père

86
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,400
