87
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,200
N'aie pas peur.

88
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,480
On y va ensemble.

89
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,880
Toute notre famille,

90
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,240
on y va ensemble.

91
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,520
Wenqian accompagne

92
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,200
tout le monde.

93
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,559
Quinze jours d'immersion.

94
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:39,360
Je présente l'encre.

95
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,120
Messieurs les juges,

96
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,920
