187
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,280
Lianji.

188
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:38,520
Ça suffit, ne dis plus rien.

189
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,680
Votre Altesse la Princesse,

190
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,160
